  empty sky) beside an editorial window carrying the brand line, with a live scroll readout.
{%- endcomment -%}
  {% block 'frame', variant: 'frame-hairline', id: 'win-scan', window: 'closed', class: 'hud-viewport [--frame-fallback:var(--color-surface)] lg:absolute lg:start-[12%] lg:top-4 lg:w-[min(26%,380px)]' %}
    <div class="panel-header">
